ations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproductible in 4.4.beta2 [a013481b0], v4.4.beta1 [d33da79d3], v4.4.dev7 [46c8f8c5c], v4.3.stable [77dcf97d8].\n- Not reproductible in any version under v4.3.stable [77dcf97d8] as `OS.execute_with_pipe()` doesn't exist.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.beta2 - Fedora Linux 41 (KDE Plasma) on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 (nvidia; 565.77) - AMD Ryzen 9 7900X 12-Core Processor (24 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nExecuting a binary (**or running nothing at all**) with `OS.execute_with_pipe()` will always freeze the engine when that function is ran again and then not freeze when doing the same again, in an alternating manner (freeze - no freeze - freeze - no freeze - ...).\n\nI am unable to test if this happens under Windows and am also unable to build the test_program binary for Windows, as I don't have mingw installed on my machine.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nRun `OS.execute_with_pipe(\"\", [])` multiple times, a binary is optional.\n\nReplace \"[global_path]/test_program\" in the MRP with the actual global path in the system for the binary (like `/home/username/Downloads/execute_with_pipe_issue/test_program`), if you're on windows you'll have to build the `.cc` file with a C++ compiler (or change the path to another executable).\n\nTo see program `stdout` change the `enable_stdout` variable to `true`.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[execute_with_pipe_issue.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18626913/execute_with_pipe_issue.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Felipe-Sena","id":93457186,"node_id":"U_kgDOBZILIg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93457186?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Felipe-Sena","html_url":"https://github.com/Felipe-Sena","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Felipe-Sena/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Felipe-Sena/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Felipe-Sena/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Felipe-Sena/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Felipe-Sena/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Felipe-Sena/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Felipe-Sena/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Felipe-Sena/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Felipe-Sena/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102273/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102273/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}